Coco the gorilla is a remarkable animal  who was taught American sign language  penny started teaching Coco as a baby  and the project continued into a  lifelong learning experience for  everyone involved by teaching Coco over  two thousand words she has been given  the power to communicate with humans it  has given us a glimpse into the actual  thoughts and desires of another species  Coco asked for a pet kitten after being  fascinated with a book about them  she named her first kid an all ball and  later when he was hit by a car we see a  reaction of non-human grief not too far  away from being human in the search for  a mate Coco was even able to join in the  age of digital dating and choose her own  match from a collection of videos  one moment that struck me was when they  bought in Coco's choice of mate and Coco  asked to break the usual protocol of  playing in adjacent yards for a few  weeks she asked to meet her new friend  straightaway there was a contrast  between what humans think is best for  animals and what the animals really want  it makes me wonder what else we get  wrong or don't understand there are many  things that I wish we could ask Coco  what answer would she give to the  meaning of life I'd like to ask her what  she thinks of humans or just how it  feels to be alive
 

